## Project Structure & Extending

```
index.html            # SPA entry (double-click to run)
assets/               # Icons (4nec2.ico / MMANA.ico)
css/style.css         # Styles (language toggle / cards / panels)
js/
  state.js            # Global N2M namespace and state
  i18n.js             # i18n mechanism (L/LF dual-view rendering, language switching)
  i18n/zh.js|en.js    # Standalone language packs (pure data, directly editable)
  utils.js            # Expression evaluation, designator positioning (pure functions)
  geometry.js         # GW/GX/GM geometry collection
  extract.js          # NEC parsing (N2M direction)
  maa2nec/            # .maa parsing / taper rebuild / symbol derivation / NEC output (M2N direction)
  convert.js          # .maa output orchestration (N2M direction)
  app.js              # UI events and flow
tests/                # 17 regression suites
docs/                 # Format docs (authoritative .maa reference) / release archives / history log / security audit
backups/              # Batch snapshots and output hash baselines
```

**Adding a UI language:** copy `js/i18n/en.js` → `js/i18n/<code>.js`, adjust `meta` and translate the entries (incomplete translations fall back to English automatically), then add one line `<script src="js/i18n/<code>.js">` in `index.html` — `node tests/i18n_lang.js` automatically validates key-set alignment.

**Format documentation:** the complete authoritative .maa reference (dual variants / field semantics / taper definitions / parser checklist) is `docs/MAA format concise reference.md`, with its companion `docs/MAA file format (corrected).md`.

